+
+The primary experiment has 20,218 matches of 34,908 cases, with 10,342 matches
+below the all-node 1e-6 V triviality threshold in both engines. The separately
+planned rescue experiment has 22,647 matches of 32,451 fixtures and retains 22
+NG_ONLY outcomes, including one timeout. These totals expose fixture/excitation
+and engine limitations; they do not certify all declared models or analyses.
+
+Source inspection also establishes that ngspice 47 maps MES netlist `M` to
+`MES_M`, whereas version 42 maps it to `MES_AREA`. Version-42 noise agreement
+must not be generalized across that semantic change. Actual noise probes now
+confirm the discrepancy in three fixtures; neither reference options nor the
